WEBVTT

00:15:56.542 --> 00:16:01.059
because we can change the action,
which changes the story,

00:16:01.083 --> 00:16:03.125
which changes the system

00:16:04.292 --> 00:16:06.143
that allows those stories to happen.

00:16:06.167 --> 00:16:10.083
Systems are just collective
stories we all buy into.

00:16:11.083 --> 00:16:13.226
When we change them,

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:17.768
we write a better reality
for us all to be a part of.

00:16:17.792 --> 00:16:19.893
I am asking us

00:16:19.917 --> 00:16:22.393
to use our power to choose.

00:16:22.417 --> 00:16:25.934
I am asking us to level up.

00:16:25.958 --> 00:16:27.226
Thank you.

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:29.684
I am Baratunde Rafiq Thurston.

00:16:29.708 --> 00:16:34.500
(Applause)